<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to April 11.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in month</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   C-C Amatil		   13.92	    21.68</p>
<p>2   Bank of Melbourne	   9.34	    14.18</p>
<p>3   Crown			   2.13	     8.51</p>
<p>4   Burswood			1.52	     7.04</p>
